# The melody played by hand, on Load Screen: a line by script as a hand would have it (off the grid, as a hand is), then Keys Arp at each division and in the patterns, Skip, a key added, Played, then Latch. Fixed seed. Times are from the start of the wav, in the comments. Not one of the tests.
#   PYTHON=.venv/bin/python3 sh build.sh --host && mkdir -p app/build/listen && app/build/host/aq1_host tests/listen/keys_melody.amb app/build/listen
wait 100
tap SAVE
wait 800
reboot
seed 3001
master 2430
trace app/build/listen/keys_melody.trace
wav keys_melody.wav
