# 35.3 s: Keys Arp (SEL + KNOB 2), a hold of D F# A C#; 1/4, Up
press SEL
spin K2 1
release SEL
setpar 9 10
key 9 down
key 13 down
key 16 down
key 20 down
wait 5647
# 40.9 s: 1/8
setpar 9 50
wait 5647
# 46.6 s: 1/16
setpar 9 90
wait 5647
# 52.2 s: Down, 1/16
setpar 33 1
wait 4236
# 56.5 s: Up-Down, 1/16
setpar 33 2
wait 4235
# 60.7 s: Random, 1/16
setpar 33 3
wait 4235
# 64.9 s: Conv, 1/16
setpar 33 4
wait 4235
# 69.2 s: PedT, 1/16
setpar 33 5
wait 4236
# 73.4 s: PedR, 1/16
setpar 33 6
wait 4235
# 77.6 s: Skip 40, Up, 1/16
setpar 33 0
setpar 34 40
wait 5647
# 83.3 s: Skip 0; a key added (E), and one let go (D), the grid not moved
setpar 34 0
key 11 down
wait 2824
key 9 up
wait 2823
key 13 up
key 16 up
key 20 up
key 11 up
# 88.9 s: all let go: it stops
wait 1412
# 90.4 s: Played, 1/8: the same notes pressed high to low
setpar 33 7
setpar 9 50
key 20 down
wait 40
key 16 down
wait 40
key 13 down
wait 40
key 9 down
wait 40
wait 4235
key 20 up
key 16 up
key 13 up
key 9 up
wait 706
setpar 33 0
# 95.5 s: Latch on (SEL + REC): a hold, let go, and it plays on at 1/8
press SEL
tap REC
release SEL
key 9 down
key 13 down
key 16 down
wait 706
key 9 up
key 13 up
key 16 up
wait 5647
# 101.8 s: a new hold replaces it: E G# B, let go
key 11 down
key 15 down
key 18 down
wait 706
key 11 up
key 15 up
key 18 up
wait 5647
# 108.2 s: a third, at 1/16
setpar 9 90
key 8 down
key 11 down
key 16 down
key 23 down
wait 353
key 8 up
key 11 up
key 16 up
key 23 up
wait 5647
# 114.2 s: a rest and back, latched: it stops and goes on
tap PLAY
wait 2824
tap PLAY
wait 2823
# 119.8 s: Latch off: gone
press SEL
tap REC
release SEL
wait 2824
# 122.6 s: the end
wavstop
trace off
expect midion2 0
expect bellson 0
